# Model service

The model-invocation plane for {{ project_title }}. The API plane calls this
service over loopback or a private network; clients never call it directly.

Phase 1 exposes `/health`, `/v1/models` and the capability endpoint shapes.
Phase 2 adds the actual runtimes:

- embeddings and rerank — ONNX Runtime with quantized small models;
- ASR — whisper.cpp / sherpa-onnx / faster-whisper;
- image — ONNX Runtime for OCR/classification/CLIP; generation stays remote by
  default;
- System One / Laya — the decision/scoring binding.

Model files are not committed. Download them on demand into a project-local
cache, verify checksums, and keep model updates separate from application
releases.

Run it with `make dev-model` from the project root, or:

```sh
cd services/model
uv sync
uv run uvicorn --factory model_app.main:create_app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8010
```
